<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Qualcomm downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Qualcomm downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns cut its rating for Qualcomm Inc to attractive from buy Wednesday, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the communications systems maker fell 3-1/8 to 48-1/2 in early trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
